},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Jade/Screenshots/5.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 5"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 0,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Appearance customization:**\n  - Lets you change almost everything: colors, background styles (e.g. blur), corner radius.\n  - Separate customization for components such as toggles, modules, the music player, sliders (volume/brightness) and the status bar.\n  - Different background styles can be set for each state (on/off).\n- **Presets:**\n  - Comes with 6 built-in presets.\n  - Lets you create, import, export and share your own presets.\n- **Gestures:**\n  - Adds custom gestures (press and hold, swipe up/down/left/right) for toggles and modules.\n  - Example: Press and hold the Wi-Fi button to open Wi-Fi settings, or swipe up on the brightness slider to toggle Dark Mode.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
